<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Packers And Movers In Karanodai
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How should I prepare a home inventory list when moving from Karanodai to another state?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Start by categorizing items room‑by‑room, noting dimensions, weight, and condition. Use a spreadsheet or mobile app to record each piece, highlighting fragile or high‑value goods. Attach photos for visual reference and assign a priority level for packing. This detailed inventory helps packers and movers in karanodai plan space, packaging needs, and insurance coverage accurately, reducing surprises during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the online rate for movers and packers in Karanodai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Online rates are shaped by distance, volume, and type of goods. Specialized items like pianos or antiques require extra handling and custom crates, raising costs. Seasonal demand, fuel price fluctuations, and any required permits for oversized loads also affect pricing. Additionally, insurance limits, GST, and any value‑added services such as disassembly or storage will be reflected in the final movers and packers online rate.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I book a vehicle to shift my house from Karanodai to a distant city, and what is the process?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, you can reserve a dedicated moving vehicle through Shree Ashirwad’s online portal or by phone. Provide the moving date, origin and destination addresses, and a preliminary inventory. The team will assign a suitable truck (18‑ft, 22‑ft, or 32‑ft MX), share a live GPS link, and confirm the booking with a detailed quotation. Payment can be made securely online, and a driver will arrive on the agreed date to begin loading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there GST implications when hiring packers and movers service in Karanodai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Packers and movers services in Karanodai are subject to the standard Goods and Services Tax (GST) at 18 % on the total invoice, which includes packing materials, labor, and transportation. The GST amount is shown separately on the bill, making it easy for corporate or government clients to claim input tax credit. Ensure the invoice displays the GSTIN of Shree Ashirwad for compliance and reimbursement purposes.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures do movers take for furniture handling inside homes in Karanodai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Movers employ a 7‑layer protective system that starts with high‑density bubble cushioning, followed by multi‑ply corrugated sheets, and reinforced edge protectors. They use padded sliders and furniture straps to prevent scratches and structural damage. Heavy items are lifted with hydraulic dollies and secured with ratchet lashings. All steps are performed by trained staff following IBA‑approved protocols, ensuring your furniture arrives intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer protective packaging system safeguard household goods during long‑haul transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system begins with 80‑gsm heavy‑duty bubble wrap to absorb shocks, then adds high‑density foam edge protectors for corners. Corrugated fiberboard sheets provide rigidity, while stretch film offers weatherproof sealing. Custom wooden crates are used for delicate items like glassware or temple idols. Each layer works together to dampen vibrations, protect against moisture, and prevent impact damage throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I expect at check‑post transit advisory points on the Karanodai to Destination Hub route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">At each check‑post, authorities verify vehicle documents, weight compliance, and hazardous material declarations. Shree Ashirwad’s drivers carry all required permits, e‑Way bills, and insurance certificates, ensuring smooth clearance. Expect brief inspections of cargo sealing and GPS tracking logs. The process typically takes 10‑15 minutes per point, and any issues are resolved on‑site thanks to pre‑approved IBA compliance.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
